    "Retired runtime copies are kept on disk under godot/assets/retired/2026-10-02/ (a .gdignore folder: never imported, exported or placed). Source assets, git history and LFS objects are untouched.",
    "Old saves keep loading: saved room-prop kinds stay valid; a kind or id whose appearance is retired resolves through legacyAppearances (null = drawn as nothing; these are inert dressing with no rules effect).",
    "Cathedral is the biome (Floors 1-5). Its tilesets are opal-lanternhouse, pendulum-conservatory and the brick (old cathedral) tileset, id cathedral (STRANGEDEEP_SHARED_MODULE_STYLE=cathedral; the pre-kit Studio/legacy presentation counts as the brick tileset). A prop in a tilesetSets entry may be placed only in that entry's allowedTilesets; change the list to retarget it."
